## the hazard combination: state.json lost AND the journal has unknown events (rollback + crash)
-- status --
.harness/ is here but state.json is missing — the state store is derived, so the event journal can rebuild it. Run `harness doctor --repair`. Do not run `harness init`: it refuses while .harness/ exists
exit=1
-- doctor --repair (the prescription) --
{
  "ok": false,
  "repaired": false,
  "refused": true,
